  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spellcraft 7 ranks, Spellhacking sphere, Prepared Hacking.</p>\n<p><strong>Target:</strong> A spell that is about to be lost by its caster due to damage or broken concentration, or a magic item mishap</p>\n<p>This hack can only be applied as a readied or immediate action because the spell or mishap is only a valid target for an instant. You replace the target’s effect with one of your (mishap) talents.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
